              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sarahmarina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "made this tonight for dinner with thinly sliced heirloom tomatoes with a bit of S&amp;P on them. just used a bit of light mayo on mine and dijon mustard and light mayo on my hubby's. I used organic light rye bread, and served with organic tomato soup from a box. We both loved it!!",
